# Two Windows devs + Rojo: store LF in the repo so diffs stay honest and the
# two machines never fight over line endings. Working trees are left alone.
* text=auto

# Roblox / art binaries — git must never "fix" these
*.rbxl   binary
*.rbxm   binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.tga    binary
*.fbx    binary
*.blend  binary
*.ogg    binary
*.mp3    binary
*.wav    binary
